WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.825
At dawn, the coastal radar falls silent.

00:00:03.825 --> 00:00:10.125
Beyond its range, relief trucks wait on a road nobody can promise is safe.

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:17.375
Your task is to restore the picture, remove the mobile launchers, and open a route to the port.

00:00:17.375 --> 00:00:22.100
A destroyed enemy base is not the measure of success.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.875
The convoy must arrive.
